# Like API

A RESTful API for managing likes on posts, built with Go and Gin framework.

## Tech Stack

- Go
- Gin Framework
- Swagger for API documentation

## Quick Start

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone https://github.com/abolfazlasad/like-api.git
cd like-api

# Install dependencies
go mod tidy

# Generate Swagger docs
swag init

# Run the application
go run main.go
```

## Documentation
Swagger: http://localhost:8080/swagger/index.html

## Branch Info

New changes and Clean Architecture refactoring are in `develop` branch

```bash
git checkout develop
```